From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:38:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Publish per-window tab and item counts for taskbar applets

Write $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/cosmic-files-tabs/<pid>.json with the window
title, the tab count and the number of items the active tab lists.
The view hook compares cached counts, and walks the item list only
when it was replaced, resized or show-hidden changed (and at most once
per 500 ms otherwise). A writer thread rewrites the file atomically,
only on change and at most once per 500 ms, and removes it when the
window closes or the app exits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

